[00:08.83]Some deserts on this planet这世上的一些沙漠
[00:12.10]Were oceans once曾是浩瀚海洋
[00:15.91]Somewhere shrouded by the night在黑夜笼罩的某处
[00:19.11]The sun will shine终将阳光普照
[00:22.99]Sometimes I see a dying bird有时我会看到一只濒死的鸟
[00:26.50]Fall to the ground坠落在地
[00:29.61]But it used to fly so high它也曾展翅翱翔
[00:35.91]I thought I were no more than a bystander我本以为自己只是个局外人
[00:40.30]Till I felt a touch so real直到我感受到了如此真切的触动
[00:42.91]I will no longer be a transient我不会再只是个匆匆过客
[00:47.49]When I see smiles with tears当我看见泪光中的微笑
[00:50.13]If I had never known the sore of farewell若我从未体会离别的伤感
[00:54.26]And the pain of sacrifice以及奉献的苦楚
[00:57.85]What else should I engrave on my mind我又该将何物铭刻于心
[01:05.40]Frozen into icy rocks凝结成冰冷的岩石
[01:08.54]That's how it starts that's how it starts故事由此展开，故事由此展开
[01:12.57]Crumbled like the sands of time如时间之沙般瓦解
[01:15.56]That's how it ends that's how it ends一切都结束了，一切都结束了
[01:19.72]Every page of tragedy每一页的悲剧
[01:22.69]Is thrown away is thrown away都被抛弃，都被抛弃
[01:27.50]Burned out in the flame在火焰中燃烧殆尽
[01:32.43]A shoulder for the past let out the cries让过去的肩膀，释放所有的哭泣
[01:37.10]Imprisoned for so long囚禁了这么久
[01:39.41]A pair of wings for me at this moment此刻，给我一双翅膀
[01:43.94]To soar above this world去翱翔于这世界之上
[01:46.69]Turn into a shooting star that briefly shines化作一颗转瞬即逝的流星
[01:50.98]But warms up every heart却温暖着每一颗心
[01:54.48]May all the beauty be blessed愿世间一切美好都得到庇佑
[02:01.45]May all the beauty be blessed愿所有美好都得到庇佑
[02:10.80]I will never go我永远不会离去
[02:16.90]There's a way back home总有一条归途
