[02:30.34]May all the beauty be blessed愿所有美好都得到庇佑
[02:43.10]Wave goodbye to the past when hope and faith当希望和信仰坚定不移，告别昨日的彷徨
[02:47.52]Have grown so strong and sound变得如此坚定
[02:49.83]Unfold this pair of wings for me again请再次为我张开这双翅膀
[02:54.51]To soar above this world翱翔于世界之上
